{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot, Sell, Survive \u2014 Profit from Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo gives you a first taste of <i>Oldish Stuff</i>, a dark and chaotic loot-driven world. As an immoral pawnshop owner, you\u2019ll enter a handcrafted biome, battle grotesque enemies, and scavenge everything for profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>What\u2019s Included in the Demo:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Fully unlocked Blood Biome</strong> \u2013 Explore a handcrafted, enemy-infested region<br>\ud83e\udddf <strong>6 enemy types</strong> \u2013 From cultists to mutants, each with unique behaviors<br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>60+ lootable items</strong> \u2013 Randomized stats and rarity for replayability<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>5 powerful weapons</strong> \u2013 Including melee and ranged options<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>13 upgradable player skills</strong> \u2013 Customize your combat style<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>3 minigames</strong> \u2013 Each with unique mechanics and increasing difficulty<br>\ud83d\udc79 <strong>1 boss fight</strong> \u2013 Confront a massive, terrifying abomination<br>\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Partial shop system</strong> \u2013 Price items, interact with early customers<br>\ud83d\udd01 <strong>High replay value</strong> \u2013 Random drops and scalable challenges ensure variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f This demo showcases a limited portion of the full game.<br>Features such as procedural biomes, full shop automation, enemy evolution, and complete localization are <strong>not included</strong> in the demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791330?t=1749478419","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791330/a86add3728ee41ccabf81c284857d9d2716f4993/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749478419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store